#: omake:omake_653B447D_0436_48FE_984C_DC0FE7E0E4E5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c7b22408148ee1af0864c880e71d9febcf6a5bdd4deb095092ab531dceefb8d0
#. default-sha256: e05340b5ea307088d0eba6611485847f6487b3e19af0c37f7117fc9c3300c83a
msgctxt "omake:omake_653B447D_0436_48FE_984C_DC0FE7E0E4E5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫Excuse me, what are you doing here?⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫"
"You. Yes, ⟪k:28⟫you⟪k:29⟫."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫Perdonami, cosa ci fai qui?⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫Sì, dico a "
"⟪k:28⟫te⟪k:29⟫."

#: omake:omake_99725F62_CFF6_4816_BE61_F39AD06CACFE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b93bc57a2080b735f0e7b291f6f60658849926fa5b3dbe505bcb0e96787790ce
#. default-sha256: 0067563cf94b21e42279040199d8e09b50268f037e9aa434b3453167f76b4e01
msgctxt "omake:omake_99725F62_CFF6_4816_BE61_F39AD06CACFE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I wish I knew how all these uninvited souls kept finding their way to my mansion."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Vorrei tanto capire perché tutte queste anime continuano ad arrivare a casa mia "
"senza nemmeno essere state invitate."

#: omake:omake_0FC36204_061C_4057_9C29_685A6FDCAD5A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4d6fb3f48fda5875e0e9ec500b60ad1ff04af27a1c178a05769b7a2476d1feba
#. default-sha256: 31535cb370ed313ce330bd9586cf3fc78d0231212a7f071d11baf441e146b5dd
msgctxt "omake:omake_0FC36204_061C_4057_9C29_685A6FDCAD5A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫If you just completed the game and would like some time to dwell on it, you are welcome "
"to head back now."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Se hai appena completato il gioco e vorresti un po’ di tempo per metabolizzare il "
"tutto, sei libero di tornare sui tuoi passi."

#: omake:omake_9790113F_2F86_4B78_AC2E_10D8DB9E56B1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7be88c7affd3fb906393fdea5149aa2a4cd356e001cf2772b6003ebed2104bba
#. default-sha256: 729a582e558194b180a1d2429871d5ac22b69d6884d013cb3a0379e35b0f86b8
msgctxt "omake:omake_9790113F_2F86_4B78_AC2E_10D8DB9E56B1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You’ll see people who shouldn’t be here. Things that contradict the events of the game. "
"A general sense of pandemonium. You’d do best not to think much of any of it."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Vedrai persone che non dovrebbero trovarsi qui.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Cose che contraddicono gli "
"eventi del gioco.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Sarà un vero pandemonio; ⟪k:6⟫faresti meglio a non dargli troppa "
"importanza."

#: omake:omake_8B5E920F_01AA_4FFF_9770_40716C0F563B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e8baa0c2c5dd8645da0da41bb8f406f8d7175a3f6b23e69b97e44f11678b6c2e
#. default-sha256: fcf2e0a3278aafa58d0c899b0732e37717b6fd6145331eb8999d5ad4e535338f
msgctxt "omake:omake_8B5E920F_01AA_4FFF_9770_40716C0F563B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I’m not particularly attached to having long hair."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Non mi importa granché tenere i capelli lunghi."

#: omake:omake_9972D410_BE8F_48F7_AC27_7AAC30A66518
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b8504aeb617ff51edcf8412d53cb568e73cd8dd8934fff12324f02d35212715f
#. default-sha256: bc2990112584dfd229256d72cf477cb1263a6bab65d7150b4cf72f5d704f9122
msgctxt "omake:omake_9972D410_BE8F_48F7_AC27_7AAC30A66518"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mmm, I’m not sure how I feel about that idea.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I quite enjoy playing with your hair, "
"myself."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Tagliarti i capelli? ⟪k:1⟫Mmmh, ⟪k:2⟫non so, sinceramente...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫A me diverte giocare "
"con i tuoi capelli."

#: omake:omake_3FF00017_67C5_48C1_A183_28621D7983CF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 97fee5d12093eccbbe1c8c006b3ab4725c28730de17eab30f8c6781ddcc0eeb8
#. default-sha256: da0f1292262ea4a8684857adb2c97f1b0d1edaf3335a4b99bea282ef97918b96
msgctxt "omake:omake_3FF00017_67C5_48C1_A183_28621D7983CF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫H-⟪k:7⟫Hey! What was that for?!⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫And be careful what "
"you wish for, quite literally!⟪k:10⟫We might actually go up in flames!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫E-⟪k:7⟫Ehi! E questo per cos’era?!⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫E poi sta’ attenta "
"a quello che desideri,⟪k:10⟫o potremmo andare a fuoco sul serio!"

#: omake:omake_4303290F_D137_4284_ACE6_B8162C7F5544
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
